description:
Checks a store like a shopping agent: anti-bot walls, robots.txt rules for shopping agents, UCP profile and checkout, storefront MCP, product structured data, and a price/stock truth check (what agents read vs. what the store shows). Read-only: never adds to cart, orders or pays. Result cached 1 h.
Use when: before buying from a store, or to know if its prices can be trusted.
Example: {"domain":"example-store.com"}
